## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a product launch?

A laser projector and screen for the reveal, PA sound with a mixing console, and a wireless handheld microphone so the presenter can move around the product. See [What a Product Launch Needs From AV](#what-a-product-launch-needs-from-av) above.

### Do you provide an LED video wall for product launches?

No, the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) is a laser projector and screen setup, not an LED video wall. The 5000-lumen laser projector is built to stay legible in a lit room.

### Can I connect my own laptop or tablet to your AV setup?

Yes. We provide HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your own laptop, tablet or media player to our screen and sound system.

### Is a technician included for a product launch?

No, not on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/): the equipment is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you or your team during the event.

### Do you provide staging or a riser for the product reveal?

No, staging is not part of the Product Presentation Pack. If your launch needs a stage or riser, see our [audio visual rental for gala dinners](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-gala-dinners/) guide, which covers the MICE Pack's optional staging.

### Do you provide live streaming or video recording for a product launch?

No, we do not provide cameras, streaming or broadcast equipment. Our setup covers the room's screen, projector and sound.

### How many microphones are included for a product launch?

The Product Presentation Pack includes 1 wireless handheld microphone. If your launch needs more than one, let us know when you book.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a product launch?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. For a launch with a fixed reveal date, book as early as you can once your venue is confirmed. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
